p.src:
The speaker then gives a useful classification of content demand: $\text{content demand}
=
\{\text{education},\ \text{entertainment}\}.$ People usually look at pages either to learn something or to be entertained. That simple split turns ideation into a feedback process. We post, inspect the analytics, and then model what worked.

